                  "to": 14.639999,
                  "from": 10.639999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 0"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2816256,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 14.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 39.16,
                  "from": 34.92,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 0"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2816266,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Hello, everyone. It's good to see that so many members of the public have shown up for our presentation on the new housing development planned on the outskirts of Nunston. I'm Mark Reynolds, and I'm communications manager at the development. I'll start by giving you a brief overview of our plans for the development. So one thing I'm sure you'll want to know is why we've selected this particular site for a housing development.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2816267,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Hello, everyone.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 43.985,
                  "from": 42.785004,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2816270,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It's good to see that so many members of the public have shown up for our presentation on the new housing development planned on the outskirts of Nunston.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 53.905003,
                  "from": 43.985,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2816299,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I'm Mark Reynolds, and I'm communications manager at the development.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 59.78,
                  "from": 54.385002,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2816310,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I'll start by giving you a brief overview of our plans for the development.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 65.62,
                  "from": 60.66,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2816325,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So one thing I'm sure you'll want to know is why we've selected this particular site for a housing development.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 74.995,
                  "from": 66.66,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2816346,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "At present, it's being used for farming, like much of the land around Nunston. But because of the new industrial centre in Nunston, there's a lot of demand for housing for employees in the region, as many employees are having to commute long distances at present. Of course, there's also the fact that we have an international airport just twenty minutes drive away. But although that's certainly convenient, it wasn't one of our major criteria for choosing the site. We were more interested in the fact that there's an excellent hospital just 15 kilometers away, and a large secondary school even closer than that.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2816347,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "At present, it's being used for farming, like much of the land around Nunston.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 82.19501,
                  "from": 75.875,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2816362,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But because of the new industrial centre in Nunston, there's a lot of demand for housing for employees in the region, as many employees are having to commute long distances at present.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 96.07,
                  "from": 83.19,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2816395,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Of course, there's also the fact that we have an international airport just twenty minutes drive away.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 104.175,
                  "from": 96.975006,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2816413,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But although that's certainly convenient, it wasn't one of our major criteria for choosing the site.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 111.855,
                  "from": 104.815,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2816430,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We were more interested in the fact that there's an excellent hospital just 15 kilometers away, and a large secondary school even closer than that.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 123.84,
                  "from": 112.96,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2816456,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "One drawback to the site is that it's on quite a steep slope, but we've taken account of that in our planning, so it shouldn't be a major problem. We've had a lot of positive feedback about the plans. People like the wide variety of accommodation types and prices, and the fact that it's only a short drive to get out into the countryside from the development. We were particularly pleased that so many people liked the designs for the layout of the development, with the majority of people saying it generally made a good impression and blended in well with the natural features of the landscape, with provision made for protecting trees and wildlife on the site. Some people have mentioned that they'd like to see more facilities for cyclists, and we'll look at that.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2816457,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "One drawback to the site is that it's on quite a steep slope, but we've taken account of that in our planning, so it shouldn't be a major problem.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 137.615,
                  "from": 125.295,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2816487,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We've had a lot of positive feedback about the plans.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 142.53001,
                  "from": 138.85,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2816498,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "People like the wide variety of accommodation types and prices, and the fact that it's only a short drive to get out into the countryside from the development.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 154.975,
                  "from": 142.93001,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2816527,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We were particularly pleased that so many people liked the designs for the layout of the development, with the majority of people saying it generally made a good impression and blended in well with the natural features of the landscape, with provision made for protecting trees and wildlife on the site.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 177.37,
                  "from": 155.695,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2816579,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Some people have mentioned that they'd like to see more facilities for cyclists, and we'll look at that.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 186.115,
                  "from": 178.83499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2816598,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "But the overall feedback has been that the design and facilities of the development make it seem a place where people of all ages can live together happily.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2816599,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But the overall feedback has been that the design and facilities of the development make it seem a place where people of all ages can live together happily.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 197.41,
                  "from": 186.19499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2816628,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 15 to 20. Now listen and answer questions 15 to 20.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2816629,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 15 to 20.",
