                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2816719,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "There'll also be a school for children up to 11 years old. If you look at the south entrance at the bottom of the map, there's a road from there that goes right up through the development. The school will be on that road, at the corner of the second turning to the left. A large sports center is planned with facilities for indoor and outdoor activities. This will be on the western side of the development, just below the road that branches off from London Road.",
            "children": [
              {
